# Menus on a desktop window: the title, How to Play (the top bar's ?),
# Settings with the erase confirmation cancelled, Records, Journey, Hosted
# Play signed out, then the Daily round's table, the pause dialog and back.
# viewport 1280x720@1
until 600 Wild Eights
frames 60
save we-title
click =How to play
until 300 Eights are wild
frames 10
save we-help
click =Back
until 300 =Settings
frames 10
click =Settings
until 300 =Erase saved progress
frames 10
save we-settings
click =Erase saved progress
until 300 =Cancel
frames 10
save we-wipe
click =Cancel
frames 10
click =Back
until 300 =Records
frames 10
click =Records
until 300 Rounds played
frames 30
save we-records
click =Back
until 300 =Hosted Play
frames 10
click =Hosted Play
until 300 Sign in with StarHermit to host
frames 10
save we-hosted
click =Back
until 300 =Daily Challenge
frames 10
click =Daily Challenge
until 600 (your turn)
frames 120
save we-daily
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 10
save we-daily-select
click =Pause
until 300 =Resume
frames 10
save we-pause
click =Leave round
until 300 =Daily Challenge
frames 10
